{"posts":[{"id":"luska_p8_176","t":"According to my daily calculations, This swing will ends at 1.0263... Coincidence theres a H4 Demand... I will take my money at 1.0265 instead and not care where its going next and start hunting for new entries... A 295 pips run is good enough... Total pips for all 3 entries if my target hit will be 786 pips... Have a nice day....\n\nAlso adding buy orders","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#176","p":8,"im":["b0dc542627f5f6dd5be00387130923c5bbc39958"],"m":176},{"id":"luska_p8_177","t":"This maybe crazy... i sold Usd/Jpy at the stop hunt of the monday high... theres sure lotsa buy stop orders sitting at 100.00 The potential exit for this setup can go as low as 93.100\n\nOf course i will be looking for signs of reversal for buy. Will let it run...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#177","p":8,"im":["192c0605c44116de2787ccf60ee07813ef98d37d"],"m":177},{"id":"luska_p8_178","t":"Oh shoot... i made a mistake...i went to my profile and accidently delete all my posts thinking like clearing cookies from my web browser... Oh well.. if it cant be retrieved then it doesnt matter... Anyway im still in the short of Usd/Jpy...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#178","p":8,"im":["192c0605c44116de2787ccf60ee07813ef98d37d"],"m":178},{"id":"luska_p8_179","t":"My Target for the bottom 2 sell are nearing and im entering a short term retracment buy...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#179","p":8,"im":["d2160a82e34a80be5bdacb696b5baea79cdf4462"],"m":179},{"id":"luska_p8_180","t":"remember this touch n run sell trade i had since 23 august...still holding till its target although FOMC is coming soon in a few days time...Pushed my SL to some profits...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#180","p":8,"im":["3f94906be213eee93e71fd101835a797ad04da50"],"m":180},{"id":"luska_p8_181","t":"Great trading Luska, keep them coming","a":"Castus","d":"","n":"#181","p":8,"im":[],"m":181},{"id":"luska_p8_182","t":"FOMC is just a news to drive price to their awaiting orders...Here is Gbp/Usd Daily Analysis..","a":"Lus