ll be monitoring for Price Action. And as usual i trade engulfing candles. Green Lines are my targets. I strongly see there is a need to test at the 1.196 where price broke out from the support. and there is a gap there.A 2nd gap from the top. The final gap will appear below 1.040 before it will finally reverse back to close the 1st gap as Target 1 at 1.3237. At 1.196 the sell target is parity 1.000 or lower. (0.9800)\n\nI will try to be more active in trading intraday setups. Till Then. Happy Profiting","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#191","p":8,"im":[],"m":191},{"id":"luska_p8_192","t":"Hi There Luska,\n\nGood you're back. Your trades seem very simple though elegant. Look forward yo more posts.\n\nThink you forgot the chart the belongs the post.\n\nBest, Art","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#192","p":8,"im":[],"m":192},{"id":"luska_p8_193","t":"Testing chart upload.... I tink its the size. Anyway GbpChf has a QM to sell","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#193","p":8,"im":["069d7b777de0d0dcf159da5bf5ee318e5a979675","594fd71b2cd616f36117f3ddbad114e7af81db51"],"m":193},{"id":"luska_p8_194","t":"GbpCad\n\nThis was spotted by a friend named Robert who asked me to look at this pair. Well here it is my analysis.\n\nSell @ 2.0360 SL 2.0420 Exit 1.9850\n\nOverview In Higher TF.\n\nIf Price decided to retest right shoulder, the price will be 2.0559 with the same exit as above.","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#194","p":8,"im":["452600165fc7585bee4fe664b0e2767a8f5fb9ae","10935630d25f4fdea82f82f3ba14a6dd93c93f7d"],"m":194},{"id":"luska_p8_195","t":"GbpJpy\n\nBear Flag Seen.....\n\nIntraday and Swing price in 2nd pic","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#195","p":8,"im":["2307d95aaacbce4cb1bd259df50b03b6c1758ba8","9d4fb40433bb1663dd5482f400103585279e4de4"],"m":195},{"id":"luska_p8_196","t":"Luska wrote:\n\nThe outcome....","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#196","p":8,"im":["069d7b777de0d0dcf159da5bf5ee318e5a979675","415cdc8d6a1d5bd99cd452a84c1cd38e220d8ce2"],"m":196},{"id":"luska_p8_197","t":"This entry is unprecedented. i was outside and was watching the chart from my fone and i saw the hunt on the upper blue arrow entry. The lower entry is also another hunt and i saw the amatuer gap.","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#197","p":8,"im":["e1c2931e9d9060c5e39cf0c0f5c32f2b1f32a0fd"],"m":197},{"id":"luska_p8_198","t":"Not bad, about last entry -was nice. I also took this level. Well done!","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#198","p":8,"im":[],"m":198},{"id":"luska_p8_199","t":"Hi Luska,\n\nI have sended a private message to you. Can you answer me, please?","a":"Trader05","d":"","n":"#199","p":8,"im":[],"m":199},{"id":"luska_p8_200","t":"I realised i missed my GbpAud buy entry by spread.\n\nBut it doesnt matter as we have a new sell entry.\n\nSell @ 2.155 SL 2.162 TP 2.025\n\nDo take note that my exit price are always the possible maximum it can go according to my analysis. i usually scale out when new setups appears.","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#200","p":8,"im":["411b3d02bab2df55fe3ac764dffa9bdb018ec79f","870d1b4e0ddf0b2d8674b683daa0fcd475f9900f"],"m":200}],"images":[{"k":"b0dc542627f5f6dd5be00387130923c5bbc39958","t":"assets/thumbs/b0dc542627f5f6dd5be00387130923c5bbc39958.webp","f":"assets/images/b0dc542627f5f6dd5be00387130923c5bbc39958.png","w":1362,"h":584,"b":25503,"o":"b0dc542627f5f6dd5be00387130923c5bbc39958.png","p":8,"pid":"luska_p8_176"},{"k":"192c0605c44116de2787ccf60ee07813ef98d37d","t":"assets/thumbs/192c0605c44116de2787ccf60ee07813ef98d37d.webp","f":"assets/images/192c0605c44116de2787ccf60ee07813ef98d37d.png","w":1362,"h":584,"b":20173,"o":"192c0605c44116de2787ccf60ee07813ef98d37d.png","p":8,"pid":"luska_p8_178"},{"k":"d2160a82e34a80be5bdacb696b5baea79cdf4462","t":"assets/thumbs/d2160a82e34a80be5bdacb696b5baea79cdf4462.webp","f":"assets/images/d2160a82e34a80be5bdacb696b5baea79cdf4462.png","w":1363,"h":709,"b":63616,"o":"d2160a82e34a80be5bdacb696b5baea79cdf4462.png","p":8,"pid":"luska_p8_179"},{"k":"3f94906be213eee93e71fd101835a797ad04da50","t":"assets/thumbs/3f94906be213eee93e71fd101835a797ad04da50.we